    "detailed_description": "Have you ever wanted to destroy a world? How about a dozen?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTake control of a pair of hatchling space dragons and blast your way through the cosmos with our innovative move-and-warp system. Fight the robotic armadas that have enslaved the massive beasts of the galaxy! Destroy suns, battle epic bosses, and leap to new systems through mind-bending wormholes!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Universal Update brings the new, improved, and dramatically expanded content from the Unchained and Dragon Bytes Quest releases to Steam!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHere are just a few of the things we\u2019ve introduced:<br />\r\n- A major overall performance boost and visual updates!<br />\r\n- New weapons for the AI enemies, including guided missiles, tracking lasers, and more!<br />\r\n- New level events and points of interest!<br />\r\n- More bullet hell. MORE!<br />\r\n- Updated boss fights!<br />\r\n- Additional level content leading up to the bosses!<br />\r\n- New story content added! Intercept transmissions throughout the game to learn more about the AI\u2019s goals and background.<br />\r\n- Localization added for French, Spanish, Italian, German, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, and Traditional Chinese added.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThank you all for your continued support!",
    "about_the_game": "Have you ever wanted to destroy a world? How about a dozen?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTake control of a pair of hatchling space dragons and blast your way through the cosmos with our innovative move-and-warp system. Fight the robotic armadas that have enslaved the massive beasts of the galaxy! Destroy suns, battle epic bosses, and leap to new systems through mind-bending wormholes!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Universal Update brings the new, improved, and dramatically expanded content from the Unchained and Dragon Bytes Quest releases to Steam!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHere are just a few of the things we\u2019ve introduced:<br />\r\n- A major overall performance boost and visual updates!<br />\r\n- New weapons for the AI enemies, including guided missiles, tracking lasers, and more!<br />\r\n- New level events and points of interest!<br />\r\n- More bullet hell. MORE!<br />\r\n- Updated boss fights!<br />\r\n- Additional level content leading up to the bosses!<br />\r\n- New story content added! Intercept transmissions throughout the game to learn more about the AI\u2019s goals and background.<br />\r\n- Localization added for French, Spanish, Italian, German, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, and Traditional Chinese added.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThank you all for your continued support!",
